# Pick ONE backend.
#
# 1. No API key -- run on your existing Claude Code subscription. The engine
#    shells out to the `claude` CLI, so runs bill your existing limits rather
#    than an API key. Requires `claude` on PATH.
LLM_BACKEND=claude-code

# 2. Metered key -- uncomment and set, and comment out LLM_BACKEND above.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# 3. Fully local -- point at any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. No key needed.
# OPENROUTER_BASE=http://localhost:11434/v1
